  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {膨|ふく}らませる (transitive — to inflate, to puff out)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{膨|ふく}らんでいる describes the resulting state of being swollen or inflated.\n\nPHYSICAL SENSE:\n- パンが{膨|ふく}らむ: bread rises\n- {風船|ふうせん}が{膨|ふく}らむ: balloon inflates\n- {蕾|つぼみ}が{膨|ふく}らむ: flower buds swell\n- ほっぺたが{膨|ふく}らむ: cheeks puff out\n\nFIGURATIVE SENSE:\n- {夢|ゆめ}が{膨|ふく}らむ: dreams grow\n- {期待|きたい}が{膨|ふく}らむ: expectations grow\n- {借金|しゃっきん}が{膨|ふく}らむ: debts pile up\n- {想像|そうぞう}が{膨|ふく}らむ: imagination expands\n\nRELATED:\n- {膨|ふく}れる: to swell, to pout (also intransitive, slightly different nuance)\n- {膨張|ぼうちょう}: expansion (noun, more technical)",
